# Rhovanion Rampager's attack trigger is a "may": Bot1 attacks on turn 3 with the Rampager (and its Memnite home) and declines to
# sacrifice, so the Memnite lives and the Rampager gets no counters (3/2; Bot2 takes 3, to 17). "When this creature dies, amass Goblins
# X, where X is this creature's power": Bot2's Lightning Bolt kills it on turn 4 and Bot1 gets a Goblin Army token with three counters.

[Bot1 Deck]
Mox Jet
Mana Crypt
Memnite
Rhovanion Rampager
Plains x16

[Bot2 Deck]
Mox Ruby
Lightning Bolt
Island x18

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Mox Jet.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot1.Hand.Mana Crypt.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot1.Hand.Memnite.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Jet.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mana Crypt.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Rhovanion Rampager.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
[T2 Bot2.Main1]
Bot2.Hand.Mox Ruby.Cast
Bot1.Pass
[T3 Bot1.Main1]
Bot1.Attack(Rhovanion Rampager > Bot2)
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
Bot1.Choose()
[T3 Bot1.Main2]
? Bot2.Life = 17
? Bot1.Battlefield.Rhovanion Rampager.Counters.PlusOnePlusOne = (absent)
[T4 Bot2.Main1]
Bot2.Battlefield.Mox Ruby.Activate
Bot2.Hand.Lightning Bolt.Cast(Rhovanion Rampager)
Bot1.Pass

[Expect]
Bot1.Graveyard = Rhovanion Rampager
Bot1.Battlefield.Memnite.Power = 1
Bot1.Battlefield.Goblin Army Token.Counters.PlusOnePlusOne = 3
Bot1.Battlefield.Goblin Army Token.Power = 3
